    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/1776.png",
      "text": "Khale khale hone ho ena le Phokojoe e lapileng haholo. E ne e lula e tsamaea ka morung e shebana le lijo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=15904#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:884c15d26d19b3e51aa57859a368991e25e2423dd86bc0a0cbf4c68f570ee985"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/1775.png",
      "text": "Eabe e fihla moo lifate tsa morara li lengoang teng. Ea bona lekala la morara le leketlileng le le holimo haholo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=15904#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:53df75dd84a31dbed9415be26da4d6dd05edd31cc136f7a0c72d5bff0811994c"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/1777.png",
      "text": "Ea inahanela hore, \"Ka 'nete ona morara o shebahala o le monate haholo.\" Ea chechela morao hanyane hore, etsebe hoea holimo-limo e qho'me ka mokhoa oo e ka khonang ka teng.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=15904#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:8ab82f266d9f78f72dee6e97b883f32cb37b74e8d529ef3795bccb6fbf86bbdd"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/1778.png",
      "text": "Morara o ne o le holimo-limo. Phokojoe ea oela ka mokokotlo e sa ts'oasa leha e se e le, moraranyana fela.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=15904#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:b08ce9b4440ae04ea4bffb66c2723693ff13d4ea959ec4a23c742a37ca246f44"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/1779.png",
      "text": "Phokojoe ea tsoha ea ea morao haholoanyane. Nakong ena e ne e se e pole'ne ho qhomela holimo-limo haholo. Ease khone ho qhomela holimo-limo haholo, empa ea oela ha bohloko haholoanyane ka mokokotlo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=15904#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:f5689a69970842028de669f6e83fd35eec6ed2f0d100339666f5dd94d5af8d83"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/1780.png",
      "text": "Phokojoe ena, ea leka eaba ea leka. Empa e sa fumana letho. Ea oala hangata-ngata fela. Ho fihleletse ho fihleletse mokokotlo oa eana o le bohloko haholo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=15904#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:31ac201734258ebb40f5413263200d209555bdd104ccf153d3563f0c6abe9e10"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/1781.png",
      "text": "Hofihleletse e be e tlohela, ea ngala ea tsamea.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=15904#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:38b9135c4823c4afcc7ff7e9e18a00681f64c2b80e5fd698be52104487711dca"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/1782.png",
      "text": "Phokojoe e ne e sa thaba hohang. Ea ema, ea hetla ho sheba morara ona hape. Ea inahana hore, \"Morara ono o bolila.\" Ea tsoela pele ka hotsamaea. Ene e se e lapile hofeta pele.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=15904#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:1a6ca78d95f30abeddee6e147672d7dcbb41e7e107549e66c95f3f2ec9d957c5"
    }
  ],
